<%- include('../layouts/header') %>

<!-- Privacy Policy Hero (Responsive with Ambient Mesh) -->
<section class="py-16 bg-white dark:bg-[#0d1715] border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-brand-border spaceship-ambient-mesh circuit-grid">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-left">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 bg-brand-50 dark:bg-brand-900/60 text-brand-600 dark:text-accent rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-sm shrink-0 leading-none" aria-hidden="true">verified_user</span>
        <span>Legal &amp; Data Security</span>
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-3 tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2 text-sm">Last updated: November 2026 &bull; Strict IP Non-Disclosure Standards &amp; AdSense Compliance</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#13221f]">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-brand-surface rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 border border-slate-200 dark:border-brand-border shadow-md space-y-8 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-brand-500 dark:text-accent shrink-0 text-xl" aria-hidden="true">description</span>
          <span>1. Information We Collect</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          When you submit an engineering consultation request, utilize interactive calculators, or subscribe to our technical newsletter, we collect contact information including your name, email address, phone number, and engineering specifications. Our servers also log standard diagnostic information (such as browser type, referring URLs, operating system, and anonymized access times) strictly for system security and network telemetry.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-brand-500 dark:text-accent shrink-0 text-xl" aria-hidden="true">lock</span>
          <span>2. Engineering IP &amp; Confidentiality</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We treat all project schematics, bill of materials (BOM), firmware source code, and system architecture details submitted through our forms or email channels with strict technical confidentiality. We routinely execute mutual Non-Disclosure Agreements (NDA) prior to preliminary architecture discovery meetings. Client technical data is never rented, licensed, or shared with external parties.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-brand-500 dark:text-accent shrink-0 text-xl" aria-hidden="true">mail</span>
          <span>3. Newsletter &amp; Opt-In Communications</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We utilize an opt-in protocol for engineering updates and newsletter subscriptions. We will never sell, rent, or share your contact email with external third-party advertisers. Every email communication includes an immediate, one-click unsubscribe mechanism.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-brand-500 dark:text-accent shrink-0 text-xl" aria-hidden="true">ads_click</span>
          <span>4. Google AdSense &amp; Third-Party Advertising Disclosures</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Embedded India serves contextual and display advertisements powered by Google AdSense and third-party advertising networks exclusively on select sections of our website (including engineering blogs and developer tools). In compliance with Google Publisher Policies, please note the following:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li><strong>Third-Party Vendors:</strong> Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites on the Internet.</li>
          <li><strong>Advertising Cookies (DoubleClick DART Cookie):</strong> Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their visits to Embedded India and/or other sites across the Internet.</li>
          <li><strong>Personalized Ads Opt-Out:</strong> Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-accent font-semibold underline inline-flex items-center gap-1"><span>Google Ads Settings</span><span class="material-symbols-rounded text-xs shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">open_in_new</span></a>. Alternatively, users can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-accent font-semibold underline inline-flex items-center gap-1"><span>www.aboutads.info</span><span class="material-symbols-rounded text-xs shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">open_in_new</span></a> or <a href="https://youronlinechoices.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-accent font-semibold underline inline-flex items-center gap-1"><span>Your Online Choices</span><span class="material-symbols-rounded text-xs shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">open_in_new</span></a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-brand-500 dark:text-accent shrink-0 text-xl" aria-hidden="true">cookie</span>
          <span>5. Cookies, Local Storage &amp; User Controls</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Our website utilizes necessary local storage to remember your theme preferences, navigation states, and cookie preferences. Optional advertising scripts remain inactive until permitted through the cookie preferences banner or settings modal. You can manage, update, or revoke your advertising cookie consent at any time via the "Cookie Settings" link located in the website footer.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-brand-500 dark:text-accent shrink-0 text-xl" aria-hidden="true">policy</span>
          <span>6. GDPR &amp; CCPA/CPRA Privacy Rights</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Under regional data protection frameworks including the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA/CPRA), users are entitled to rights of access, rectification, data portability, and erasure of personal records. We do not sell your personal data. To exercise any data privacy rights, contact our privacy desk at the address below.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-brand-500 dark:text-accent shrink-0 text-xl" aria-hidden="true">contact_support</span>
          <span>7. Contacting Us</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, your technical data, or advertising choices, please contact:
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-brand-dark border border-slate-200 dark:border-brand-border flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Embedded India Legal &amp; Compliance</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5"><%= settings.contact_address || 'Hyderabad, India' %></p>
          </div>
          <a href="mailto:<%= settings.contact_email || 'info@embeddedindia.in' %>" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-brand-500 hover:bg-brand-600 text-white rounded-xl font-bold text-xs transition shadow-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-base shrink-0 leading-none" aria-hidden="true">mail</span>
            <span><%= settings.contact_email || 'info@embeddedindia.in' %></span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('../layouts/footer') %>